27180076}, {"id": 35, "seek": 11450, "start": 124.82, "end": 127.74, "text": " They were indignant, and they said to him,", "tokens": [50881, 814, 645, 1016, 36818, 11, 293, 436, 848, 281, 796, 11, 51027], "temperature": 0.8, "avg_logprob": -0.3468350682939802, "compression_ratio": 1.5494071146245059, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016609871527180076}, {"id": 36, "seek": 11450, "start": 128.2, "end": 130.02, "text": " Do you hear what these are saying?", "tokens": [51050, 1144, 291, 1568, 437, 613, 366, 1566, 30, 51141], "temperature": 0.8, "avg_logprob": -0.3468350682939802, "compression_ratio": 1.5494071146245059, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016609871527180076}, {"id": 37, "seek": 11450, "start": 130.74, "end": 132.32, "text": " And Jesus said to them,", "tokens": [51177, 400, 2705, 848, 281, 552, 11, 51256], "temperature": 0.8, "avg_logprob": -0.3468350682939802, "compression_ratio": 1.5494071146245059, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016609871527180076}, {"id": 38, "seek": 11450, "start": 133.12, "end": 135.4, "text": " Yes, have you never read?", "tokens": [51296, 1079, 11, 362, 291, 1128, 1401, 30, 51410], "temperature": 0.8, "avg_logprob": -0.3468350682939802, "compression_ratio": 1.5494071146245059, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016609871527180076}, {"id": 39, "seek": 11450, "start": 135.78, "end": 140.28, "text": " Out of the mouth of infants and nursing babies you have prepared praise.", "tokens": [51429, 5925, 295, 264, 4525, 295, 38829, 293, 15423, 10917, 291, 362, 4927, 13286, 13, 51654], "temperature": 0.8, "avg_logprob": -0.3468350682939802, "compression_ratio": 1.5494071146245059, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016609871527180076}, {"id": 40, "seek": 11450, "start": 140.74, "end": 144.28, "text": " And leaving them, he went out of the city to Bethany and Lod\u044f\u0442,", "tokens": [51677, 400, 5012, 552, 11, 415, 1437, 484, 295, 264, 2307, 281, 14011, 1325, 293, 441, 378, 4558, 11, 51854], "temperature": 0.8, "avg_logprob": -0.3468350682939802, "compression_ratio": 1.5494071146245059, "no_speech_prob": 0.0016609871527180076}, {"id": 41, "seek": 14450, "start": 144.5, "end": 151.44, "text": " there. In the morning, as he was returning to the city, he became hungry, and seeing a fig tree by", "tokens": [50365, 456, 13, 682, 264, 2446, 11, 382, 415, 390, 12678, 281, 264, 2307, 11, 415, 3062, 8067, 11, 293, 2577, 257, 2147, 4230, 538, 50712], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06779390648950505, "compression_ratio": 1.5628415300546448, "no_speech_prob": 0.27490222454071045}, {"id": 42, "seek": 14450, "start": 151.44, "end": 159.38, "text": " the wayside, he went to it and found nothing on it but only leaves. And he said to it, May no fruit", "tokens": [50712, 264, 636, 1812, 11, 415, 1437, 281, 309, 293, 1352, 1825, 322, 309, 457, 787, 5510, 13, 400, 415, 848, 281, 309, 11, 1891, 572, 6773, 51109], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06779390648950505, "compression_ratio": 1.5628415300546448, "no_speech_prob": 0.27490222454071045}, {"id": 43, "seek": 14450, "start": 159.38, "end": 166.24, "text": " ever come from you again. And the fig tree withered at once. When the disciples saw it,", "tokens": [51109, 1562, 808, 490, 291, 797, 13, 400, 264, 2147, 4230, 365, 4073, 412, 1564, 13, 1133, 264, 17209, 1866, 309, 11, 51452], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06779390648950505, "compression_ratio": 1.5628415300546448, "no_speech_prob": 0.27490222454071045}, {"id": 44, "seek": 16624, "start": 166.24, "end": 175.62, "text": " they marveled, saying, How did the fig tree wither at once? And Jesus answered them,", "tokens": [50365, 436, 23893, 292, 11, 1566, 11, 1012, 630, 264, 2147, 4230, 365, 260, 412, 1564, 30, 400, 2705, 10103, 552, 11, 50834], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07675552859748762, "compression_ratio": 1.6604651162790698, "no_speech_prob": 1.7231490346603096e-05}, {"id": 45, "seek": 16624, "start": 176.34, "end": 182.98000000000002, "text": " Truly I say to you, if you have faith and do not doubt, you will not only do what has been done to", "tokens": [50870, 43548, 286, 584, 281, 291, 11, 498, 291, 362, 4522, 293, 360, 406, 6385, 11, 291, 486, 406, 787, 360, 437, 575, 668, 1096, 281, 51202], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07675552859748762, "compression_ratio": 1.6604651162790698, "no_speech_prob": 1.7231490346603096e-05}, {"id": 46, "seek": 16624, "start": 182.98000000000002, "end": 189.0, "text": " the fig tree, but even if you say to this mountain, Be taken up and thrown into the sea,", "tokens": [51202, 264, 2147, 4230, 11, 457, 754, 498, 291, 584, 281, 341, 6937, 11, 879, 2726, 493, 293, 11732, 666, 264, 4158, 11, 51503], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07675552859748762, "compression_ratio": 1.6604651162790698, "no_speech_prob": 1.7231490346603096e-05}, {"id": 47, "seek": 16624, "start": 189.48000000000002, "end": 196.22, "text": " it will happen. And whatever you ask in prayer, you will receive, if you have faith.", "tokens": [51527, 309, 486, 1051, 13, 400, 2035, 291, 1029, 294, 8767, 11, 291, 486, 4774, 11, 498, 291, 362, 4522, 13, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07675552859748762, "compression_ratio": 1.6604651162790698, "no_speech_prob": 1.7231490346603096e-05}, {"id": 48, "seek": 19624, "start": 196.24, "end": 203.94, "text": " And when he entered the temple, the chief priests and the elders of the people came up to him as he", "tokens": [50365, 400, 562, 415, 9065, 264, 10184, 11, 264, 9588, 27192, 293, 264, 22737, 295, 264, 561, 1361, 493, 281, 796, 382, 415, 50750], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12803744361514136, "compression_ratio": 1.7257383966244726, "no_speech_prob": 0.003823702922090888}, {"id": 49, "seek": 19624, "start": 203.94, "end": 209.06, "text": " was teaching, and said, By what authority are you doing these things? And who gave you this", "tokens": [50750, 390, 4571, 11, 293, 848, 11, 3146, 437, 8281, 366, 291, 884, 613, 721, 30, 400, 567, 2729, 291, 341, 51006], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12803744361514136, "compression_ratio": 1.7257383966244726, "no_speech_prob": 0.003823702922090888}, {"id": 50, "seek": 19624, "start": 209.06, "end": 217.22, "text": " authority? Jesus answered them, I also will ask you one question, and if you tell me the answer,", "tokens": [51006, 8281, 30, 2705, 10103, 552, 11, 286, 611, 486, 1029, 291, 472, 1168, 11, 293, 498, 291, 980, 385, 264, 1867, 11, 51414], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12803744361514136, "compression_ratio": 1.7257383966244726, "no_speech_prob": 0.003823702922090888}, {"id": 51, "seek": 19624, "start": 217.78, "end": 223.4, "text": " then I also will tell you by what authority I do these things. The baptism of John,", "tokens": [51442, 550, 286, 611, 486, 980, 291, 538, 437, 8281, 286, 360, 613, 721, 13, 440, 34352, 295, 2619, 11, 51723], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12803744361514136, "compression_ratio": 1.7257383966244726, "no_speech_prob": 0.003823702922090888}, {"id": 52, "seek": 19624, "start": 223.58, "end": 224.92000000000002, "text": " from where did it come?", "tokens": [51732, 490, 689, 630, 309, 808, 30, 51799], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12803744361514136, "compression_ratio": 1.7257383966244726, "no_speech_prob": 0.003823702922090888}, {"id": 53, "seek": 19624, "start": 225.62, "end": 226.22, "text": " From heaven.", "tokens": [51834, 3358, 7162, 13, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12803744361514136, "compression_ratio": 1.7257383966244726, "no_speech_prob": 0.003823702922090888}, {"id": 54, "seek": 22624, "start": 226.24, "end": 231.32000000000002, "text": " From heaven or from man? And they discussed it among themselves, saying,", "tokens": [50365, 3358, 7162, 420, 490, 587, 30, 400, 436, 7152, 309, 3654, 2969, 11, 1566, 11, 50619], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13276446206229073, "compression_ratio": 1.5933609958506223, "no_speech_prob": 0.010086926631629467}, {"id": 55, "seek": 22624, "start": 231.86, "end": 238.26000000000002, "text": " If we say from heaven, he will say to us, Why then did you not believe him? But if we say from man,", "tokens": [50646, 759, 321, 584, 490, 7162, 11, 415, 486, 584, 281, 505, 11, 1545, 550, 630, 291, 406, 1697, 796, 30, 583, 498, 321, 584, 490, 587, 11, 50966], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13276446206229073, "compression_ratio": 1.5933609958506223, "no_speech_prob": 0.010086926631629467}, {"id": 56, "seek": 22624, "start": 238.56, "end": 242.18, "text": " we are afraid of the crowd, for they all hold that John was a prophet.", "tokens": [50981, 321, 366, 4638, 295, 264, 6919, 11, 337, 436, 439, 1797, 300, 2619, 390, 257, 18566, 13, 51162], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13276446206229073, "compression_ratio": 1.5933609958506223, "no_speech_prob": 0.010086926631629467}, {"id": 57, "seek": 22624, "start": 242.96, "end": 249.46, "text": " So they answered Jesus, We do not know. And he said to them,", "tokens": [51201, 407, 436, 10103, 2705, 11, 492, 360, 406, 458, 13, 400, 415, 848, 281, 552, 11, 51526], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13276446206229073, "compression_ratio": 1.5933609958506223, "no_speech_prob": 0.010086926631629467}, {"id": 58, "seek": 22624, "start": 249.94, "end": 255.54000000000002, "text": " Neither will I tell you by what authority I do these things. What do you think?", "tokens": [51550, 23956, 486, 286, 980, 291, 538, 437, 8281, 286, 360, 613, 721, 13, 708, 360, 291, 519, 30, 51830], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13276446206229073, "compression_ratio": 1.5933609958506223, "no_speech_prob": 0.010086926631629467}, {"id": 59, "seek": 25554, "start": 255.54, "end": 262.56, "text": " A man had two sons, and he went to the first and said, Son, go and work in the vineyard today.", "tokens": [50365, 316, 587, 632, 732, 13476, 11, 293, 415, 1437, 281, 264, 700, 293, 848, 11, 5185, 11, 352, 293, 589, 294, 264, 12755, 13862, 965, 13, 50716], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06635532756843189, "compression_ratio": 1.7128712871287128, "no_speech_prob": 0.010567812249064445}, {"id": 60, "seek": 25554, "start": 263.06, "end": 269.96, "text": " And he answered, I will not. But afterward he changed his mind and went. And he went to the", "tokens": [50741, 400, 415, 10103, 11, 286, 486, 406, 13, 583, 40411, 415, 3105, 702, 1575, 293, 1437, 13, 400, 415, 1437, 281, 264, 51086], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06635532756843189, "compression_ratio": 1.7128712871287128, "no_speech_prob": 0.010567812249064445}, {"id": 61, "seek": 25554, "start": 269.96, "end": 277.84, "text": " other son and said the same. And he answered, I go, sir, but did not go. Which of the two", "tokens": [51086, 661, 1872, 293, 848, 264, 912, 13, 400, 415, 10103, 11, 286, 352, 11, 4735, 11, 457, 630, 406, 352, 13, 3013, 295, 264, 732, 51480], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06635532756843189, "compression_ratio": 1.7128712871287128, "no_speech_prob": 0.010567812249064445}, {"id": 62, "seek": 25554, "start": 277.84, "end": 284.42, "text": " did the will of his father? They said, The first. Jesus said to them,", "tokens": [51480, 630, 264, 486, 295, 702, 3086, 30, 814, 848, 11, 440, 700, 13, 2705, 848, 281, 552, 11, 51809], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06635532756843189, "compression_ratio": 1.7128712871287128, "no_speech_prob": 0.010567812249064445}, {"id": 63, "seek": 28442, "start": 284.42, "end": 290.96000000000004, "text": " Truly I say to you, the tax collectors and the prostitutes go into the kingdom of God before you.", "tokens": [50365, 43548, 286, 584, 281, 291, 11, 264, 3366, 35384, 293, 264, 10293, 270, 1819, 352, 666, 264, 10231, 295, 1265, 949, 291, 13, 50692], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11526963975694444, "compression_ratio": 2.007782101167315, "no_speech_prob": 0.002415275666862726}, {"id": 64, "seek": 28442, "start": 291.7, "end": 297.84000000000003, "text": " For John came to you in the way of righteousness, and you did not believe him. But the tax collectors", "tokens": [50729, 1171, 2619, 1361, 281, 291, 294, 264, 636, 295, 26407, 11, 293, 291, 630, 406, 1697, 796, 13, 583, 264, 3366, 35384, 51036], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11526963975694444, "compression_ratio": 2.007782101167315, "no_speech_prob": 0.002415275666862726}, {"id": 65, "seek": 28442, "start": 297.84000000000003, "end": 303.74, "text": " and the prostitutes believed him. And even when you saw it, you did not afterward change your", "tokens": [51036, 293, 264, 10293, 270, 1819, 7847, 796, 13, 400, 754, 562, 291, 1866, 309, 11, 291, 630, 406, 40411, 1319, 428, 51331], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11526963975694444, "compression_ratio": 2.007782101167315, "no_speech_prob": 0.002415275666862726}, {"id": 66, "seek": 28442, "start": 303.74, "end": 307.78000000000003, "text": " minds and believe him. Hear another parable.", "tokens": [51331, 9634, 293, 1697, 796, 13, 30685, 1071, 971, 712, 13, 51533], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11526963975694444, "compression_ratio": 2.007782101167315, "no_speech_prob": 0.002415275666862726}, {"id": 67, "seek": 28442, "start": 308.36, "end": 313.38, "text": " There was a master of a house, who planted a vineyard and put a fence around it and dug a", "tokens": [51562, 821, 390, 257, 4505, 295, 257, 1782, 11, 567, 17395, 257, 12755, 13862, 293, 829, 257, 15422, 926, 309, 293, 22954, 257, 51813], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11526963975694444, "compression_ratio": 2.007782101167315, "no_speech_prob": 0.002415275666862726}, {"id": 68, "seek": 28442, "start": 313.38, "end": 314.22, "text": " winepress in it. He put a vineyard and put a fence around it and dug a winepress in it,", "tokens": [51813, 7209, 11637, 294, 309, 13, 634, 829, 257, 12755, 13862, 293, 829, 257, 15422, 926, 309, 293, 22954, 257, 7209, 11637, 294, 309, 11, 51855], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11526963975694444, "compression_ratio": 2.007782101167315, "no_speech_prob": 0.002415275666862726}, {"id": 69, "seek": 31442, "start": 314.42, "end": 318.94, "text": " and built a tower, and leased it to tenants and went into another country.", "tokens": [50365, 293, 3094, 257, 10567, 11, 293, 476, 1937, 309, 281, 31216, 293, 1437, 666, 1071, 1941, 13, 50591], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14320815310758703, "compression_ratio": 1.9328358208955223, "no_speech_prob": 2.8188462238176726e-05}, {"id": 70, "seek": 31442, "start": 319.94, "end": 325.22, "text": " When the season for fruit drew near, he sent his servants to the tenants to get his fruit.", "tokens": [50641, 1133, 264, 3196, 337, 6773, 12804, 2651, 11, 415, 2279, 702, 21705, 281, 264, 31216, 281, 483, 702, 6773, 13, 50905], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14320815310758703, "compression_ratio": 1.9328358208955223, "no_speech_prob": 2.8188462238176726e-05}, {"id": 71, "seek": 31442, "start": 325.7, "end": 330.70000000000005, "text": " And the tenants took his servants and beat one, killed another, and stoned another.", "tokens": [50929, 400, 264, 31216, 1890, 702, 21705, 293, 4224, 472, 11, 4652, 1071, 11, 293, 342, 19009, 1071, 13, 51179], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14320815310758703, "compression_ratio": 1.9328358208955223, "no_speech_prob": 2.8188462238176726e-05}, {"id": 72, "seek": 31442, "start": 331.42, "end": 336.06, "text": " Again he sent other servants more than the first, and they did the same to them.", "tokens": [51215, 3764, 415, 2279, 661, 21705, 544, 813, 264, 700, 11, 293, 436, 630, 264, 912, 281, 552, 13, 51447], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14320815310758703, "compression_ratio": 1.9328358208955223, "no_speech_prob": 2.8188462238176726e-05}, {"id": 73, "seek": 31442, "start": 337.20000000000005, "end": 343.70000000000005, "text": " Finally he sent his son to them, saying, They will respect my son. But when the tenants saw", "tokens": [51504, 6288, 415, 2279, 702, 1872, 281, 552, 11, 1566, 11, 814, 486, 3104, 452, 1872, 13, 583, 562, 264, 31216, 1866, 51829], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14320815310758703, "compression_ratio": 1.9328358208955223, "no_speech_prob": 2.8188462238176726e-05}, {"id": 74, "seek": 31442, "start": 343.70000000000005, "end": 344.40000000000003, "text": " the son, they did not believe him. And he said, I go, sir, but did not go. Which of the two did", "tokens": [51829, 264, 1872, 11, 436, 630, 406, 1697, 796, 13, 400, 415, 848, 11, 286, 352, 11, 4735, 11, 457, 630, 406, 352, 13, 3013, 295, 264, 732, 630, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14320815310758703, "compression_ratio": 1.9328358208955223, "no_speech_prob": 2.8188462238176726e-05}, {"id": 75, "seek": 34440, "start": 344.4, "end": 349.29999999999995, "text": " they? They said to themselves, This is the heir. Come, let us kill him and have his", "tokens": [50365, 436, 30, 814, 848, 281, 2969, 11, 639, 307, 264, 30038, 13, 2492, 11, 718, 505, 1961, 796, 293, 362, 702, 50610], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1170594327084653, "compression_ratio": 1.7848101265822784, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004511943843681365}, {"id": 76, "seek": 34440, "start": 349.29999999999995, "end": 356.0, "text": " inheritance. And they took him and threw him out of the vineyard and killed him. When therefore", "tokens": [50610, 32122, 13, 400, 436, 1890, 796, 293, 11918, 796, 484, 295, 264, 12755, 13862, 293, 4652, 796, 13, 1133, 4412, 50945], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1170594327084653, "compression_ratio": 1.7848101265822784, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004511943843681365}, {"id": 77, "seek": 34440, "start": 356.0, "end": 363.91999999999996, "text": " the owner of the vineyard comes, what will he do to those tenants? They said to him, He will put", "tokens": [50945, 264, 7289, 295, 264, 12755, 13862, 1487, 11, 437, 486, 415, 360, 281, 729, 31216, 30, 814, 848, 281, 796, 11, 634, 486, 829, 51341], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1170594327084653, "compression_ratio": 1.7848101265822784, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004511943843681365}, {"id": 78, "seek": 34440, "start": 363.91999999999996, "end": 369.82, "text": " those wretches to a miserable death, and let out the vineyard to other tenants, who will give him", "tokens": [51341, 729, 261, 1505, 3781, 281, 257, 22321, 2966, 11, 293, 718, 484, 264, 12755, 13862, 281, 661, 31216, 11, 567, 486, 976, 796, 51636], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1170594327084653, "compression_ratio": 1.7848101265822784, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004511943843681365}, {"id": 79, "seek": 34440, "start": 369.82, "end": 373.53999999999996, "text": " the fruits in their seasons. Jesus said to them,", "tokens": [51636, 264, 12148, 294, 641, 15050, 13, 2705, 848, 281, 552, 11, 51822], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1170594327084653, "compression_ratio": 1.7848101265822784, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004511943843681365}, {"id": 80, "seek": 37354, "start": 373.54, "end": 380.3, "text": " Have you never read in the Scriptures? The stone that the builders rejected has become the", "tokens": [50365, 3560, 291, 1128, 1401, 294, 264, 46522, 30, 440, 7581, 300, 264, 36281, 15749, 575, 1813, 264, 50703], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10138770937919617, "compression_ratio": 1.5950413223140496, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002434565540170297}, {"id": 81, "seek": 37354, "start": 380.3, "end": 388.64000000000004, "text": " cornerstone. This was the Lord's doing, and it is marvelous in our eyes. Therefore I tell you,", "tokens": [50703, 4538, 11243, 13, 639, 390, 264, 3257, 311, 884, 11, 293, 309, 307, 34920, 294, 527, 2575, 13, 7504, 286, 980, 291, 11, 51120], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10138770937919617, "compression_ratio": 1.5950413223140496, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002434565540170297}, {"id": 82, "seek": 37354, "start": 388.98, "end": 394.14000000000004, "text": " the kingdom of God will be taken away from you and given to a people producing its fruits.", "tokens": [51137, 264, 10231, 295, 1265, 486, 312, 2726, 1314, 490, 291, 293, 2212, 281, 257, 561, 10501, 1080, 12148, 13, 51395], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10138770937919617, "compression_ratio": 1.5950413223140496, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002434565540170297}, {"id": 83, "seek": 37354, "start": 394.68, "end": 401.0, "text": " And the one who falls on this stone will be broken to pieces. And when it falls on anyone,", "tokens": [51422, 400, 264, 472, 567, 8804, 322, 341, 7581, 486, 312, 5463, 281, 3755, 13, 400, 562, 309, 8804, 322, 2878, 11, 51738], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10138770937919617, "compression_ratio": 1.5950413223140496, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002434565540170297}, {"id": 84, "seek": 37354, "start": 401.0, "end": 402.82000000000005, "text": " it will crush him.", "tokens": [51738, 309, 486, 10321, 796, 13, 51829], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10138770937919617, "compression_ratio": 1.5950413223140496, "no_speech_prob": 0.0002434565540170297}, {"id": 85, "seek": 40354, "start": 403.54, "end": 408.34000000000003, "text": " When the chief priests and the Pharisees heard his parables, they perceived that he was speaking", "tokens": [50365, 1133, 264, 9588, 27192, 293, 264, 47742, 279, 2198, 702, 971, 2965, 11, 436, 19049, 300, 415, 390, 4124, 50605], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.050571502423753925, "compression_ratio": 1.469387755102041, "no_speech_prob": 0.004941459745168686}, {"id": 86, "seek": 40354, "start": 408.34000000000003, "end": 414.04, "text": " about them. And although they were seeking to arrest him, they feared the crowds because", "tokens": [50605, 466, 552, 13, 400, 4878, 436, 645, 11670, 281, 7823, 796, 11, 436, 30629, 264, 26070, 570, 50890], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.050571502423753925, "compression_ratio": 1.469387755102041, "no_speech_prob": 0.004941459745168686}, {"id": 87, "seek": 40354, "start": 414.04, "end": 415.8, "text": " they held him to be a prophet.", "tokens": [50890, 436, 5167, 796, 281, 312, 257, 18566, 13, 50978], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.050571502423753925, "compression_ratio": 1.469387755102041, "no_speech_prob": 0.004941459745168686}], "language": "English"}